WEBVTT

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:01.469
reprogram them
by putting a series of genetic factors

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:02.845
and push them back in time

00:03:02.887 --> 00:03:06.557
so that those skin cells
become stem cells.

00:03:06.599 --> 00:03:07.892
It's like cellular alchemy.

00:03:09.101 --> 00:03:11.812
These stem cells
have almost magical abilities

00:03:11.812 --> 00:03:14.523
to turn into any other cell type.

00:03:14.523 --> 00:03:15.858
So what do we do?

00:03:15.858 --> 00:03:19.820
We take the stem cells,
we dissociate them,

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:21.155
we then aggregate them

00:03:21.155 --> 00:03:25.034
so that they form spheres
or tiny balls of cells.

00:03:25.076 --> 00:03:28.371
We then take those,
move them into a special plate

00:03:28.412 --> 00:03:30.790
where there is a kind of chemical soup.